usv_mpc_ws/artifacts/

# Runtime artifacts: RL training outputs (rl_models/, rl_runs/).
# Only artifacts/README.md is tracked; the rest is reproducible or machine-local.
# 用 artifacts/* 而非 artifacts/，否则目录级忽略会让下面的 negation 失效。
artifacts/*
!artifacts/README.md

